{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Buy Price Calculator 是一款反向折扣計算工具，適合在促銷前衡量實際售價是否達到心中門檻的消費者。你只需輸入原價與願意支付的價格，它便會計算出所需折扣百分比；現時原價 US $0.99，<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-31.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>反向計算所需折扣</h2>\n<p>輸入原價與實際願意支付的價格，Buy Price Calculator 會反向計算達到目標價所需的折扣百分比；例如原價 120、目標價 90，即代表需要 25% 折扣。你可儲存比較紀錄，待減價時重看，亦可計入稅項及探索疊加折扣。此 App 不會追蹤商店、監察價格、預測減價或發送降價通知；購買門檻由你設定，計算交由 App 完成。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-38-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-39-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-40-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-41-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-42-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Buy Price Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Shopping</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/buy-price-calculator/id6804756267?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:52.067257+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":340,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:52:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T18:18:46.427123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:33.494265+00:00","content_hash":"db98a5d96a4577b4162313f7c15012d96210a01d7a7612582e3baa549c53c3da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}